/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helmets with unique buffs and abilities to enhance your playstyle and give you the edge in every battle! \u26a1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303790/extras/59c09d174baa21782ae9c2821a2bcf17.poster.avif?t=1749365600\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303790/extras/59c09d174baa21782ae9c2821a2bcf17.webm?t=1749365600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303790/extras/59c09d174baa21782ae9c2821a2bcf17.mp4?t=1749365600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From boosting your speed during slides to extending your bullet time, each helmet offers something powerful to fit your needs. Whether you\u2019re dashing through enemies or slowing time in the heat of battle, these helmets are your best friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303790/extras/8279ff4219618ef72f7c34d98a616553.poster.avif?t=1749365600\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303790/extras/8279ff4219618ef72f7c34d98a616553.webm?t=1749365600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303790/extras/8279ff4219618ef72f7c34d98a616553.mp4?t=1749365600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip, upgrade, and dominate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the update now and find t